# Changesets artifacts
# Changeset files are the release record: they are the input to
# `changeset version`, which writes each package's CHANGELOG and bumps its
# version. Ignoring them meant none was ever tracked, so the `changesets are
# valid` CI job could never pass on a real PR and no release could be cut.
!.changeset/*.md
# Next.js build output
dist-test-tmp
examples/nextjs/.next/

# Astro generated types and cache
apps/docs/.astro/

# Storybook build output: generated by `storybook build`, never committed.
apps/storybook/storybook-static/
